{"id":"6deaff22ee062525","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance.md","title":"Tarski’s Wrapped Instance in the Book","display":"df-smullyan-wrapped-instance — Tarski’s Wrapped Instance in the Book","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance"],"display":"df-smullyan-wrapped-instance — Tarski’s Wrapped Instance in the Book","source":"第 II 章 pp. 24–25，Proposition 2（PDF 41–42）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering]]","[[92-lem-smullyan-numeral-code]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-wrapped-instance — Tarski’s Wrapped Instance in the Book"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 pp. 24–25，Proposition 2（PDF 41–42）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e05c7a445ae4a4cd\" href=\"?note=e05c7a445ae4a4cd\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering\">92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6ba7593680ce3de6\" href=\"?note=6ba7593680ce3de6\" title=\"92-lem-smullyan-numeral-code\">92-lem-smullyan-numeral-code</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in E_E\">\\(X\\in E_E\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；字符串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_1^E,\\nu_n^E\">\\(v_1^E,\\nu_n^E\\)</span> 来自原书字母表。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_E:E_E\\times\\mathbb N\\to E_E\">\\(W_E:E_E\\times\\mathbb N\\to E_E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_E:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(r_E:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是下文定义的 wrapper 与码函数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_1=g_E(\\forall v_1^E\\mathtt{(}v_1^E=)\">\\(\\kappa_1=g_E(\\forall v_1^E\\mathtt{(}v_1^E=)\\)</span>；右侧是字面字符前缀，其写法按原书保留括号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}wrapped\\text{-}instance}\\vdash\\quad\nW_E(X,n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall v_1^E\\mathtt{(}v_1^E=\\nu_n^E\\supset X\\mathtt{)},\\\\\nr_E(e,n)&amp;\\coloneqq\n((((\\kappa_1*_{13}13^n)*_{13}8)*_{13}e)*_{13}3),\\\\\ng_E(W_E(E_e,n))&amp;=r_E(e,n).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}wrapped\\text{-}instance}\\vdash\\quad\nW_E(X,n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall v_1^E\\mathtt{(}v_1^E=\\nu_n^E\\supset X\\mathtt{)},\\\\\nr_E(e,n)&amp;\\coloneqq\n((((\\kappa_1*_{13}13^n)*_{13}8)*_{13}e)*_{13}3),\\\\\ng_E(W_E(E_e,n))&amp;=r_E(e,n).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>书中把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_E(F,n)\">\\(W_E(F,n)\\)</span> 写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F[n]\">\\(F[n]\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 是公式且自由变量至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_1^E\">\\(v_1^E\\)</span>，则它是闭句，并与真正代入的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(n)\">\\(F(n)\\)</span> 逻辑等价；两者不是同一个字符串。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 不是公式，wrapper 仍是合法表达式，但可能没有公式意义。</p>\n<p>所需算术码运算是固定前缀、数码码、蕴涵符号码、原表达式码、右括号码的左结合拼接；无须在这一阶段算术化一般替换操作。旧库的三元 Subst 属于另一标准重构。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 II 章 pp. 24–25，Proposition 2（PDF 41–42）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"e05c7a445ae4a4cd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-lem-smullyan-numeral-code","status":"resolved","id":"6ba7593680ce3de6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-lem-smullyan-numeral-code]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in E_E","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"v_1^E,\\nu_n^E","display":false},{"tex":"W_E:E_E\\times\\mathbb N\\to E_E","display":false},{"tex":"r_E:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_1=g_E(\\forall v_1^E\\mathtt{(}v_1^E=)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}wrapped\\text{-}instance}\\vdash\\quad\nW_E(X,n)&\\coloneqq\\forall v_1^E\\mathtt{(}v_1^E=\\nu_n^E\\supset X\\mathtt{)},\\\\\nr_E(e,n)&\\coloneqq\n((((\\kappa_1*_{13}13^n)*_{13}8)*_{13}e)*_{13}3),\\\\\ng_E(W_E(E_e,n))&=r_E(e,n).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"W_E(F,n)","display":false},{"tex":"F[n]","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"v_1^E","display":false},{"tex":"F(n)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1795,"backlinks":[{"id":"da69678f58652b67","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e68521c447f8d753","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"634d28e30ada0b29","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$W_E(F,0)$ 是原书 $F[\\bar0]$ 的包裹串，见 [[92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance]]；全部构造器沿用原书串文法。"},{"id":"bd6b982556489ede","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这里严格沿用原书的 $F(n)$ 字符串；Tarski 的 $F[n]$ 是另外的量词包裹串，见 [[92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance]]，不是本函数的别名。"},{"id":"725c1f1651ce9a00","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书先定义闭数码代入，随后定义变量改名；它的量词包裹 F[n] 刻意避免算术化一般代入。本文给更一般的 G 项代入。原书数码实例见 [[92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution]]；包裹见 [[92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance]]。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance]] → [[92-df-smullyan-diagonal-code]] → [[92-df-smullyan-binary-wrapper]]记载原书 $\\mathcal L_E$ 的具体操作。连接运算按左结合解释，并保留合法串拼接的条件。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-86","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-188","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance]]"}],"outgoing":["e05c7a445ae4a4cd","6ba7593680ce3de6"]}